<td id="S4.T10.7.15.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left" style="padding-left:5.5pt;padding-right:5.5pt;"><span id="S4.T10.7.15.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:70%;">HoT w. MotionAGFormer (CVPR’24) <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite">[<a href="#bib.bib21" title="" class="ltx_ref">21</a>]</cite></span></td>
